    },
    {
      "text": "I can already barely reason about one AI-generated code base. And you want me to run millions of these? You're not describing a capability. You're describing my worst problem multiplied.",
      "timestamp_sec": 531,
      "why": "the strongest objection, quoted from a skeptical CTO"
    },
    {
      "text": "The brittleness that you're picturing is a specific type of failure mode. It's unmanaged divergence inside a single artifact.",
      "timestamp_sec": 531,
      "why": "her rebuttal locates brittleness in structure, not in AI generation"
